= About Me

I am a Postdoctoral Research Scientist at Amazon Robotics. Prior to this, I earned my Ph.D. from the Autonomous and Intelligent Robotics (AIR) Laboratory in the Department of Mechanical Engineering at Lehigh University, advised by Prof. Nader Motee. Before joining Lehigh, I obtained my B.E. degree at Beijing Institute of Technology.

== Education
- *Ph.D. in Mechanical Engineering*, Lehigh University, 2024
- *B.E. in Mechanical Engineering*, Beijing Institute of Technology